{"kind":"deck","format":"deez.nut","version":2,"name":"CCAR-P Exam Prep — P2"}
{"kind":"note","note_type":"basic","fields":["P2 synthesis — defend the architecture choice for this case: A design reviewer is evaluating this scenario: A stakeholder says, “Build us an autonomous agent.” What should the architect do first? Which recommendation should they defend?","Clarify the business outcome, constraints, and measurable success criteria. Architecture starts from the outcome and constraints; “agent” is an implementation hypothesis. This P1 variant tests the same approved principle in a re-framed design review."],"tags_json":"[\"ccarp\",\"d1\",\"obj:d1.1\",\"priority:p2\",\"kind:scenario\",\"source:approved\"]"}
{"kind":"note","note_type":"basic","fields":["P2 edge-case review — what action should survive scrutiny here? Apply the approved translating business problems into Claude-based solutions guidance to this case: A finance workflow must classify expenses but refunds over $500 require exact enforcement. Where should the $500 rule live?","In deterministic policy/authorization logic outside the model. Hard thresholds should not depend on probabilistic model compliance. This P1 variant tests the same approved principle in a re-framed design review."],"tags_json":"[\"ccarp\",\"d1\",\"obj:d1.1\",\"priority:p2\",\"kind:scenario\",\"source:approved\"]"}
{"kind":"note","note_type":"basic","fields":["P2 judgment check for translating business problems into Claude-based solutions: state the best recommendation without answer choices. Which response best preserves the architecture principles in this situation? A team has not defined what “better customer support” means. What is the best architecture next step?","Define measurable outcome and acceptance criteria before selecting components. A solution cannot be evaluated without a measurable target. This P1 variant tests the same approved principle in a re-framed design review."],"tags_json":"[\"ccarp\",\"d1\",\"obj:d1.1\",\"priority:p2\",\"kind:scenario\",\"source:approved\"]"}
{"kind":"note","note_type":"basic-reverse","fields":["Outcome requirement — D1.1 application — P2 synthesis lens for translating business problems into Claude-based solutions","The measurable value or change the solution should create."],"tags_json":"[\"ccarp\",\"d1\",\"obj:d1.1\",\"priority:p2\",\"kind:compare\",\"source:approved\"]"}
{"kind":"note","note_type":"basic-reverse","fields":["Risk constraint — D1.1 application — P2 synthesis lens for translating business problems into Claude-based solutions","A condition defining what the system must not do without stronger controls."],"tags_json":"[\"ccarp\",\"d1\",\"obj:d1.1\",\"priority:p2\",\"kind:compare\",\"source:approved\"]"}
